#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_asiapay
msgid ""
"# AsiaPay\n"
"\n"
"## Technical details\n"
"\n"
"API: Client Post Through Browser version `3.67`\n"
"\n"
"This module integrates AsiaPay using the generic payment with redirection flow based on form\n"
